  "differenceEachWayEC": 37.5,
  "boundary": "Two whole strongest-response research challenges, not accepted alternatives. Closest concept integrates actual network/OS and software/algorithm study with law, public policy, human influence, digital publics, misinformation and empirical inquiry. Risk/organization trial replaces algorithmic depth, AI decision modelling and peace/conflict integration with actual organizational culture/change, supervised survey research, AI-business governance and recipient-tested extremism prevention. No attack/defence laboratory, cybervictimology, forensic-investigation practice, cybersecurity-control program or unprovided project theme is invented.",
  "advisoryProgression": "Programming and legal gateways precede all formal dependents. Data science precedes machine learning in first trial; social psychology precedes behavioural statistics. BENGATE102 precedes both organizational-psychology courses in the second. Calling Bullshit is offered only in later spring terms, so it is not forced into a missing fall slot. Legal and empirical foundations precede final policy/rights analysis; advanced courses without formal prerequisites remain permitted."
